  "contract": "Classify Markdown dialect syntax before the native renderer runs. Keep the borrowed source authoritative; render the current CommonMark subset and show bounded original source with a visible reason for known syntax outside that subset.",
  "implementation": {
    "document_layer": "crates/doc exposes a read-only preview analysis using pinned pulldown-cmark = 0.13.4 (MIT), matching the version in egui_commonmark 0.25.0.",
    "ui_layer": "crates/ui-egui continues through egui_commonmark for supported content and shows unsupported source as monospace text after a visible notice.",
    "dependencies_and_limitations": "docs/architecture/markdown-preview.md records the renderer relationship and states that full editing, safe HTML projection, wiki-link/highlight rendering, math, and diagrams remain incomplete."
  },
